		}
		{
			x: 0.0d
			y: -8.0d
			description: ["烹饪锅是制作 Farmer's Delight 和 Nether's Delight 添加的大多数食谱所必需的。"]
			dependencies: ["3BF523FEA04D39F1"]
			id: "5F1E9CC2C3102DB6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1ED42A2B3EB0D900"
				type: "item"
				item: "farmersdelight:cooking_pot"
			}]
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "62D7615E7E58E3B2"
					type: "ftbmoney:money"
					ftb_money: 10L
				}
				{
					id: "75EF6CB3EDEC065A"
					type: "item"
					item: {
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						Count: 1b
						tag: {
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"To truly become a master chef, you will need to track down all types of crops, meat, honey, and more. In this book you will find my notes of each dish I cooked before being recognized as a master.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Vegetable Soup\\n\\nTo Make Vegetable Soup, make sure to have a bowl to put it into. Once you do, take a Potato, a Beetroot, a Carrot, and a Cabbage or Cabbage Slice and cook them in a cooking pot, then enjoy.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Shepherd's Pie\\n\\nTo make Shepherd's Pie, you won't need the cooking pot. Simply take 3 Cooked Mutton, 2 Onions, 2 Baked Potatoes, 1 Bottle or Bucket of Milk, and 1 Bowl, craft them together, and make the pie. You won't be able to eat it in this form, so place it and\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"take a serving with a bowl.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Honey Glazed Ham\\n\\nMuch like the Shepherd's Pie, the Honey Glazed Ham is a recipe that is not prepared in a Cooking Pot, but instead in your Crafting Table.\\nSimply take 1 Bowl, 1 Honey Bottle, 4 Sweet Berries, 2 Cooked Rice, and 1 Smoked Ham and combine them.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Like with the Shepherd's Pie, this is one that you will have to place and take individual servings with a bowl.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Ratatouille\\n\\nTo make Ratatouille, place 1 Tomato, 1 Onion, 1 Beetroot, and 1 of any other vegetable into your Cooking Pot.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Mixed Salad\\n\\nThe Mixed Salad is likely the easiest of all of the recipes that you will find in this book. Just take 1 Cabbage or Cabbage Leaf, 1 Onion, 1 Beetroot, and 1 Tomato and combine them with a bowl in your Crafting Table.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Roasted Mutton Chops\\n\\nMaking Roasted Mutton Chops is done with a Crafting Table. Place 1 Cooked Mutton Chops, 1 Cooked Rice, 1 Bowl, 1 Tomato, and 1 Beetroot together to make this dish.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Grilled Salmon\\n\\nTo make Grilled Salmon, take a Cooked Salmon or a Cooked Salmon Slice and combine it with 1 Bowl, 1 Onion, 1 Sweet Berry, and 1 Cabbage or Cabbage Leaf in your Crafting Table.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Squid Ink Pasta\\n\\nSquid Ink doesn't sound like something that belongs on pasta, but it's surprisingly good. To make this dish, take any form of raw fish and combine it with an Ink Sac, a Tomato, and some Raw Pasta in your Cooking Pot.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Pasta with Meatballs\\n\\nThe classic. Take a slice of Minced Beef, a serving of Raw Pasta, and a bowl of Tomato Sauce and put them into your Cooking Pot to make this dish.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Steak and Potatoes\\n\\nSteak and Potatoes are another classic dish that most probably know. To make them, take a Steak, a Baked Potato, an Onion, a Bowl, and a bowl of Cooked Rice and combine them in your Crafting Table.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Chicken Soup\\n\\nChicken Soup is another very simple dish. Just take any form of Raw Chicken and toss it into the cooking pot alongside a Carrot and either a Cabbage or Cabbage Leaf, then add any vegetable of your choice.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Pumpkin Soup\\n\\nTo make Pumpkin Soup, take a Pumpkin Slice and add a Cabbage or Cabbage Leaf, a Raw Porkchop or Raw Bacon, and a Milk Bucket or Milk Bottle. Place them all into your Cooking Pot, then enjoy your meal.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Vegetable Noodles\\n\\nVegetable Noodles are made by placing 1 Carrot, 1 Red or Brown Mushroom, 1 serving of Raw Pasta, 1 Cabbage or Cabbage Leaf, and 1 of any vegetable of your choice into your Cooking Pot.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Noodle Soup\\n\\nTo make Noodle Soup, place 1 serving of Raw Pasta into your Cooking Pot alongside 1 Fried Egg, 1 Dried Kelp, and either 1 Raw Porkchop or 1 Raw Bacon.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Fish Stew\\n\\nAnother fairly simple dish is Fish Stew. Just take 1 of any kind of raw fish, 1 bowl of Tomato Sauce, and 1 Onion and toss them into the Cooking Pot to make this easy yet filling meal.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Stuffed Pumpkin\\n\\nThe Stuffed Pumpkin is quite possibly one of the hardest dishes to make, but it is really worth doing so. In order to make this dish, place 1 Rice, 1 bowl of Tomato Sauce, 1 of any vegetable, 1 Baked Potato, 1 Brown Mushroom Colony, and 1 Sweet Berry into the\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Cooking Pot. However, you must replace the bowls that most of your previous dishes have been going into with an uncarved Pumpkin. Once you have finished cooking this dish, you must place it on a block and use bowls to take individual servings of it.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Beef Stew\\n\\nBeef Stew is the result of taking 1 Raw Beef or 1 Minced Beef and adding in 1 Carrot and 1 Potato. Very simple and very filling.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Baked Cod Stew\\n\\nBaked Cod Stew is made by putting 1 Raw Cod or Raw Cod Slice, 1 Tomato, 1 Potato, and 1 Egg into the Cooking Pot.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Roast Chicken\\n\\nTo make a Roast Chicken, you will need your Crafting Table instead of your Cooking Pot. Place 1 Onion, 1 Egg, 1 loaf of Bread, 2 Carrots, 2 Baked Potatoes, 1 Cooked Chicken, and 1 Bowl into the crafting grid. Much like the previously mentioned\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Stuffed Pumpkin, the Roast Chicken needs to be placed onto a block and split into multiple servings using bowls.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Bacon and Eggs\\n\\nBacon and Eggs are another Crafting Table recipe. Take 2 Cooked Bacon, 2 Fried Eggs, and 1 Bowl and combine them together for a quite filling meal.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Pasta with Mutton Chops\\n\\nPasta with Mutton Chops is like the Pasta with Meatballs that you have previously read about in this book. To make this dish, take 1 Raw Mutton or Raw Mutton Chops, 1 serving of Raw Pasta, and 1 bowl of Tomato Sauce and place them\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"into the Cooking Pot.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Fried Rice\\n\\nTo create Fried Rice, place 1 Carrot, 1 Egg, 1 Rice, 1 Corn, and 1 Onion into your Cooking Pot.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Now that you have read this entire book, and hopefully cooked and eaten each meal contained within, you will be considered a master chef. You have definitely earned that title.\"}"
							]
							title: "旧版配方书"
							author: "FlavorsofPieYT"
						}
					}
				}
			]
		}
